    "type": "question",
    "label": "13",
    "prompt": "A family travelling to Albury cover one-third of the journey before 1 p.m. and a further one-quarter of the journey between 1 p.m. and 2 p.m. What fraction of the journey have they travelled by 2 p.m.?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{7}{12}$ of the journey",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{1}{4}&=\\frac{4}{12}+\\frac{3}{12}\\\\\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{1}{4}&=\\frac{7}{12}\\end{align*}$$\nThey have travelled $\\frac{7}{12}$ of the journey by 2 p.m.",
